00:34:10,119 --> 00:34:11,440
You're not my wife now.

585
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:16,440
My dear,

586
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:19,360
I'll accompany you to escort goods

587
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:20,880
whenever I'm free.

588
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:23,360
You won't be lonely.

589
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:35,000
Watch your steps. Don't look back.

590
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:37,800
One, two, one, two.
